AM_1区域A置信度0.9时段10:00:05-10:00:20、CAM_2区域A置信度0.7）进行合并去重，已知第1条与第2条为同一摄像头同一区域重复事件，最终输出唯一事件列表","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","params":{"视频对象":"CAM_1, CAM_2","监控目标":"交通拥堵","时间范围":"10:00:00-10:00:10, 10:00:05-10:00:20","输出形式":"唯一事件列表"},"scene_mode":"single","scenes":["video_surveillance"],"task_spans":[{"task_span_id":"span_515d08","text":"我这里有三条事件候选，请合并成唯一事件列表：\n1) CAM_1 交通拥堵 ROI_A 置信度0.6 10:00:00-10:00:10\n2) CAM_1 交通拥堵 ROI_A 置信度0.9 10:00:05-10:00:20\n3) CAM_2 交通拥堵 ROI_A 置信度0.7\n第 1 条和第 2 条是同一摄像头同一区域的重复事件。"}],"planning_steps":[{"task_span_id":"span_986fad","text":"提取三条候选事件的结构化字段，按视频监控场景参数（摄像头编号、监控区域ROI、目标类型、置信度、起止时间）进行规范化解析，输出结构化事件明细表。"},{"task_span_id":"span_29a55c","text":"基于视频安防巡检去重逻辑，以摄像头ID与ROI标识为联合判别条件对明细表进行分组匹配，识别设备与空间范围完全一致的重复事件簇并打标签。"},{"task_span_id":"span_58439a","text":"对重复事件簇执行时空特征融合，计算时间窗口的并集区间，并按置信度取高或加权规则更新评估指标，输出合并后的单一事件记录。"},{"task_span_id":"span_15dbf3","text":"将融合记录与无重复关联的独立事件进行交叉校验，确认无冲突后统一格式化封装，交付包含完整元数据的唯一交通拥堵事件列表。"}],"scene_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_cd30b6","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将把视频监控场景中涉及CAM_1和CAM_2交通拥堵目标及10:00:00-10:00:10与10:00:05-10:00:20时间范围的三条候选事件（含CAM_1区域A置信度0.6时段10:00:00-10:00:10、CAM_1区域A置信度0.9时段10:00:05-10:00:20、CAM_2区域A置信度0.7）进行合并去重，已知第1条与第2条为同一摄像头同一区域重复事件，最终输出唯一事件列表。","params":{"视频对象":"CAM_1, CAM_2","监控目标":"交通拥堵","时间范围":"10:00:00-10:00:10, 10:00:05-10:00:20","输出形式":"唯一事件列表"}}],"sub_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_cd30b6","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将把视频监控场景中涉及CAM_1和CAM_2交通拥堵目标及10:00:00-10:00:10与10:00:05-10:00:20时间范围的三条候选事件（含CAM_1区域A置信度0.6时段10:00:00-10:00:10、CAM_1区域A置信度0.9时段10:00:05-10:00:20、CAM_2区域A置信度0.7）进行合并去重，已知第1条与第2条为同一摄像头同一区域重复事件，最终输出唯一事件列表。","params":{"视频对象":"CAM_1, CAM_2","监控目标":"交通拥堵","时间范围":"10:00:00-10:00:10, 10:00:05-10:00:20","输出形式":"唯一事件列表"}}],"task_hints":["提取必填参数：视频对象。需要分析的监控视频、摄像头、视频流、录像文件、实时画面、卡口视频或视频帧","提取可选参数：监控目标。需要识别或分析的对象、行为或事件，如人员聚集、车辆违停、越界、烟火、异常停留、摔倒、入侵、打架、遗留物、通行计数等","提取可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口","提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要"],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.9,"reason":"llm_scene_slot_rewrite","_source_message_key":"id:4b44a411-5868-48bf-ad37-cbc8432f866b"},"routing_context":{"route_mode":"scene_filter","trigger":true,"primary_goal":"我这里有三条事件候选，请合并成唯一事件列表：\n1) CAM_1 交通拥堵 ROI_A 置信度0.6 10:00:00-10:00:10\n2) CAM_1 交通拥堵 ROI_A 置信度0.9 10:00:05-10:00:20\n3) CAM_2 交通拥堵 ROI_A 置信度0.7\n第 1 条和第 2 条是同一摄像头同一区域的重复事件。","scene_tasks":[{"scene_task_id":"task_001","segment_id":"seg_001","segment_text":"我这里有三条事件候选，请合并成唯一事件列表：\n1) CAM_1 交通拥堵 ROI_A 置信度0.6 10:00:00-10:00:10\n2) CAM_1 交通拥堵 ROI_A 置信度0.9 10:00:05-10:00:20\n3) CAM_2 交通拥堵 ROI_A 置信度0.7\n第 1 条和第 2 条是同一摄像头同一区域的重复事件。","scene":"video_surveillance","input_refs":[],"task_types":[],"selected_skills":[{"id":"analyze-video","role":"primary","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"batch-video-ingestion","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"camera-health-check","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"city-video-intelligence","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"duplicate-event-merge","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"evidence-package-generation","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"evidence-snapshot","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"ffmpeg-utils","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"frame-sampling","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"human-review-routing","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-detection","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-statistics","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-tracking","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"privacy-masking","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"roi-mapping","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"single-video-event-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-embedding-index","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-object-analytics","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-search","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-segment-extraction","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-stream-ingestion","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null}],"expected_outputs":[],"depends_on":[]}],"global_selected_skills":["analyze-video","batch-video-ingestion","camera-health-check","city-video-intelligence","duplicate-event-merge","evidence-package-generation","evidence-snapshot","ffmpeg-utils","frame-sampling","human-review-routing","object-detection","object-statistics","object-tracking","privacy-masking","roi-mapping","single-video-event-analysis","video-embedding-index","video-object-analytics","video-search","video-segment-extraction","video-stream-ingestion"],"default_public_skill_ids":[],"global_allowed_tools":[],"confidence":1.0,"route_reason":"SkillRouter disabled; injected all custom skills for detected intent scene as LeadAgent candidate skills","allowed_skills":["analyze-video","batch-video-ingestion","camera-health-check","city-video-intelligence","duplicate-event-merge","evidence-package-generation","evidence-snapshot","ffmpeg-utils","frame-sampling","human-review-routing","object-detection","object-statistics","object-tracking","privacy-masking","roi-mapping","single-video-event-analysis","video-embedding-index","video-object-analytics","video-search","video-segment-extraction","video-stream-ingestion"],"selection_owner":"lead_agent","_source_message_key":"id:4b44a411-5868-48bf-ad37-cbc8432f866b"},"dialogue_context":{"act":"new_task","confidence":0.7,"reason":"no_pending_action_match","parsed_answer":null,"pending_action_id":null,"resume_intent_context":null,"resume_routing_context":null,"metadata":{}},"final_scope_skill_ids":["analyze-video","batch-video-ingestion","camera-health-check","city-video-intelligence","duplicate-event-merge","evidence-package-generation","evidence-snapshot","f